        "TileImage": "$($repository 80051c02-e026-40fe-970a-7b7aaa62302c).Image",
        "Description": "Wazir Kale, aka The Maelstrom, is a very interesting target for Roulette, as he changes his behaviour and route based on the chosen start. Manipulate that to your advantage, and take out 4 additional unique NPCs that are often visited for their disguises.\r\rAdditionally, back in RR7, competitor Mario had completed the spin and only needed to exit. Sadly the train exit he went for ended up killing him 20 minutes into the map, resulting in one of the most iconic last moment heartbreaks in RR history. Good luck and remember: It&#39;s not over until it&#39;s over.",
